CHANGES IN THIS FORK

This is a modified version. It targets build 42 only; everything that existed
solely to support build 41 has been removed. The changes are described below,
and every file that was changed carries the change in its own history.

  Layout
    The build 41 tree under mods/ImmersiveSolarArrays/media was removed and the
    versioned folder renamed from 42.1 to 42, so the mod loads on any 42.x.

  Translations
    Converted from the build 41 Translate/<LANG>/<File>_<LANG>.txt tables to the
    JSON files build 42 reads. Build 42 loads no .txt translations at all, so
    every string in the mod had been rendering as its own key.

  Item scripts
    Rewritten against build 42: ItemType replaces Type, LearnedRecipes replaces
    TeachedRecipes, DisplayName is dropped in favour of ItemName.json, and item
    tags are namespaced.

  Craft recipes
    Tag queries namespaced, recipe names given a prefix and stripped of spaces,
    and the recipe hooks rewritten against the build 42 OnCreate and OnTest
    signatures. Build 42 removed recipecode.lua and the global Recipe table the
    originals hung off.

  Multiplayer
    Generator plugging, generator activation, battery transfer, panel connection
    and the bank's own switch all went through the server system directly, which
    does not exist on a multiplayer client. They now travel as commands, which
    the server already had handlers for.

  Fixes
    Loot distributions no longer corrupt the vanilla tables they extend; stash
    houses register their containers and their map annotations; battery banks
    can spawn in rooms again; several nil dereferences on unloaded squares are
    guarded.

  Removed
    An unfinished survival guide entry, and the dead generator helpers left over
    from the build 41 implementation.


