SOFT DEPENDENCY

  Target Square: On Load Commands
    By Poltergeist. Steam Workshop 2969455858.

    Not bundled and not modified. The author asks that it not be re-uploaded,
    so players install it themselves and this mod only calls its API.

    The world spawn system uses it to place crates when a square first loads.
    The call is a soft require: without the mod the crates do not spawn and
    everything else works unchanged. It is declared in mod.info as
    require=TargetSquareOnLoad.
